#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.pow:1 of
msgid "Element-wise exponentiation (``lf ** other``)."
msgstr "元素级指数运算（``lf ** other``）。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.pow:3 of
msgid ""
"Bound to the ``**`` operator (``__pow__``), so ``lf ** other`` is "
"equivalent to ``lf.pow(other)``."
msgstr ""
"绑定到 ``**`` 运算符（``__pow__``），因此 ``lf ** other`` 等价于 ``lf.pow"
"(other)``。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.pow of
msgid "参数"
