#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.pow:6 of
msgid "Exponent applied to each element of ``lf``."
msgstr "应用于 ``lf`` 每个元素的指数。"

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.pow of
msgid "返回"
msgstr ""

#: maxframe.liteframe.arithmetic.binary.pow:9 of
msgid "Lazy frame with each element of ``lf`` raised to the power ``other``."
msgstr "每个元素都提升到 ``other`` 次幂的惰性框架。"

